;: ff.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written: logic-block flip-flops
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk BB
Base FG
Config X:QX Y: F:A G: DX:F DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:K
Equate F = A
Endblk
Editblk BC
Base FG
Config X: Y:QY F: G:A:B DX: DY:G ENCLK:EC RSTDIR: CLK:K:NOT
Equate G = A*B
Endblk
Editblk BD
Base FG
Config X:QX Y: F: G: DX:DI DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR:RD CLK:K
Endblk
Editblk BE
Base FG
Config X:QX Y:QY F:QX G:QX:QY DX:F DY:G ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:K
Equate F = ~QX
Equate G = QX@QY
Endblk
Editblk P13
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P2
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P3
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P4
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P5
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P6
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P7
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P8
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P9
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P10
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P11
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Addnet CLKPAD TCLKIN.I GCLK.I
Addnet CLK GCLK.O BB.K BC.K BD.K BE.K
Addnet D0 P2.I BB.A
Addnet D1 P3.I BC.A
Addnet D2 P4.I BC.B
Addnet EN P5.I BC.EC
Addnet DI P6.I BD.DI BD.RD
Addnet Q0 BB.X P7.O
Addnet Q1 BC.Y P8.O
Addnet Q2 BD.X P9.O
Addnet Q3 BE.X P10.O
Addnet Q4 BE.Y P11.O
